<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-argonauta-argo-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Argonauta argo Schnakenberg critical mode at the 95 µm Holocene tier — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The growth GIF's last frame is the critical mode plus grain 0.40. Official CV similarity against the plate is 86.2 (smooth control 80.2; neighbouring amplitudes 0.25 and 0.50 score 85.7 and 84.9). The radial overlay on the comparison figure has r=0.99934. Deduction: the plate is slightly irregular and carries a caption and scale bar; the reconstruction is an axisymmetric mode, and the plate itself is a prepared gallery image rather than a raw micrograph." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
